# Token hygiene (short)

- Prefer a **fresh session** after long OpenSpec continue/apply/archive chains or when the context is already huge.
- If provider stats show **stuck ~18k cache_read** and **large cache_write every turn**, stop and compact/restart — history mutation is thrashing the prompt cache.
- For long implement/apply loops, prefer **low/off thinking** unless the user asks otherwise.
- Read [`notes/agent-reference/`](../../notes/agent-reference/) and huge measurement/datasheet dumps **only when needed**; do not preload them.
- Do not put API tokens into tracked `.omp/mcp.json`.
